  "notes": [
    "Restores Blackwater locker entry and exit: the authored door swings open, the player moves inside, and the view settles behind the vents. Leaving reverses the motion and restores movement after the door closes.",
    "Corrects locker orientation, shows padlocks only on locked cabinets, and synchronizes entry and exit door motion for co-op survivors.",
    "Pausing freezes the locker animation. Occupied exits keep the player safely inside; hunters that witnessed entry can still catch the player.",
    "Windows 10/11 x64. Close the game, choose Check for updates, then Update & restart. Everyone in a co-op group should update."
  ],
